## Fonts

The interface self-hosts **Inter**, **Fraunces**, and **JetBrains Mono** from
`static/fonts/`. Each is licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; the
license texts are alongside the font files as `OFL-*.txt`.

## Starter portraits

The three bundled starter portraits are public-domain works from Wikimedia
Commons, cropped and re-encoded:

- Captain Elias Thorne — *Portrait of Captain James Cook*.
- Dr. Margaret Finch — *Maria Sibylla Merian*.
- Lucien Vane — *Young Man Playing the Lute* by Jan van Bijlert.

The source images are in the public domain; the crops are distributed with the
app under the same terms as the rest of the seed content.

## Model catalog

Provider and model metadata in `src/lib/models-dev.json` is generated from
[models.dev](https://models.dev), which is MIT licensed. The snapshot is
committed so the setup wizard works offline and makes no third-party request.
Refresh it with `pnpm models:sync`.
